==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[Znache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Zombies are the main threat of this stage, but there isn't any boss in this stage. This stage is rushable with high leveled Cat Units, but those who may struggle here should bring [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie cats]] like [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Lumbercat]] or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pole Vaulter Cat]]. [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] can be sent to force the peons to burrow so stronger units closer to the Cat Base can defeat them with ease. Overall, the zombies are weak enough to the point where you can just use what loadout you normally use for zombie outbreaks.

